    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "164c9e53_32122ced",
        "filename": "internal/chacha20/chacha_arm64.s",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 35,
      "author": {
        "id": 7530
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-04-20T15:08:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "According to \"Cortex A57 Software Optimization\" latency of VTBL is 3 same as both VSRI and VSHL.\nBut for VTBL we need to load table data into register which will need VLD (latency 5).",
      "parentUuid": "bd1abdb1_e4356b2d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 35,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "c4148a71d969ed55fbbdb5cb3a5e5d4ebbadc256",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c1098c4d_d2edf391",
        "filename": "internal/chacha20/chacha_arm64.s",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 35,
      "author": {
        "id": 25702
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-04-20T15:18:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The load is outside of the loop so only once. We\u0027ll be replacing VSRI and VSHL (3+3 cycles) with a single VTBL(3 cycles) inside the loop. On Amberwing it is 2 cycles each for VSRI and VSHL so we are saving 1 cycle inside the loop and it improved the performance by 5%.",
      "parentUuid": "164c9e53_32122ced",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 35,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "c4148a71d969ed55fbbdb5cb3a5e5d4ebbadc256",
      "serverId": "62eb7196-b449-3ce5-99f1-c037f21e1705",
      "unresolved": true
    },
